                    <span class="about-card__brand">
                        Zandrel
                    </span>

                </div>

                <div class="about-card__message">

                    <span>
                        Tecnología con propósito
                    </span>

                    <strong>
                        Resolver primero.
                        Complicar nunca.
                    </strong>

                </div>

                <div class="about-card__principles">

                    <div class="about-card__principle">

                        <span class="about-card__principle-number">
