                        </span>

                    </div>

                    <div class="about-card__principle">

                        <span class="about-card__principle-number">
                            03
                        </span>

                        <span>
                            Construir
                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="about-card__footer">

                    <span class="about-card__footer-dot"></span>

                    <span>
